{"id":"n27260-11-4","stage":0,"title":"말 · 引出话题","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27260-11-4-1","ko":"친구를 만났는데 말이야.","zh":"说起来，我见了个朋友。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친구를","meaning":"朋友","explanation":"친구（朋友）＋를（宾格助词）；是“见面”的对象。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구를","audio":"/audio/3c7703f0cd2530410491.mp3"}},{"text":"만났는데","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만났는데","audio":"/audio/01b3cf79559b6e7f1a67.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"说起来、你听我说","explanation":"말이야 用在句末引起对方注意，暗示后面还有话要说；这里相当于“说起来……”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"朋友","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"引出后话的语气表达","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"引出后话的语气表达","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/dce87f697ecb6b5fab08.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27260-11-4-2","ko":"응, 그런데?","zh":"嗯，然后呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"嗯、是","explanation":"응：非敬语的肯定或应答；这里回应对方，催促继续讲。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그런데?","meaning":"然后呢？","explanation":"그런데 可连接并转换话题；单独回答“그런데?”时，这里是在问“然后呢？”。","readings":[{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70717","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"嗯、是","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"嗯、是","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"30c94182141ace2f","term":"그런데","zh":"那么、然后呢","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3","entryId":"70717","definition":"那么、然后呢","pronunciation":["그런데"]}],"audio":"/audio/7f948ab9a7e96f2b6b89.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":0.88,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27260","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"11","sourceLevel":"초급","day":4,"sequenceScore":-0.2811,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，然后呢？","说起来，我见了个朋友。","会有多少位客人来呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["说起来，我见了个朋友。","会有多少位客人来呢？","嗯，然后呢？"],"answer":2}]}
